      "description": "Offline Survival Kit is the ultimate wilderness and emergency reference guide fully offline, no internet required.\n\n  Whether you're hiking, camping, or preparing for emergencies, this app gives\n  you the knowledge you need when it matters most.\n\n  WHAT'S INSIDE:\nPlants - Identify edible, medicinal and toxic plants with detailed\n  descriptions, habitats and warnings\nAnimals - Know which animals are dangerous and how to react in an\n  encounter\nSkills - Step-by-step survival skills: shelter, fire, water, navigation,\n  food and more\nDisasters - Preparation and survival guides for floods, storms,\n  earthquakes, wildfires and more\nFirst Aid - Critical first aid scenarios including CPR, bleeding,\n  poisoning, hypothermia and more\nBookmarks - Save your most important guides for instant access\nSearch - Find anything instantly across all categories\n\n  100% OFFLINE\n  All content is stored on your device. No Wi-Fi, no cellular data needed —\n  works anywhere in the world.\n\n  MULTILINGUAL\n  Available in English, Dutch, German, French and Spanish.\n\n  Perfect for hikers, campers, preppers, scouts, outdoor enthusiasts and anyone\n  who wants to be prepared.",
